              "color": "#232323"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section article content1\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-text col-12 col-md-8 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article><p><br></p><div>\n</div><div><b>Kirloskar : Range :\n</b></div><div>•\tKC Series (Single Stage) : KC-2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 9, 12\n</div><div>•\tKC Series (Two Stage) : KC-21, 31, 42, 51, 63, 72, 84, 93, 102\n</div><div>•\tK 110 Series : K20 x 110, K30 x 110, K40 x 110, K60 x 110\n</div><div>•\tAC 70 Series : AC-470, 570, 670, 770, 870, 1070, 1270, 1470, 1670 \n</div><div>•\tAC 80 Series : AC-480, 580, 680, 780, 880, 1080, 1280, 1480, 1680 , PC-2\n</div><div>•\tFK-3, FK-4, GK-25, K-70, CLS-61 and CLS-81\n</div><div>•\tRC Series : 11, 12, 12E\n</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Sabroe : Range:\n</b></div><div>•\tSMC 100 Series: SMC-4-100, 6-100, 8-100, SMC 104 S, 106 S, 112 S, 116 S, SMC 104 J, 106 J, 108 J, 112 J , 116 J, SMC 104 E, 106 E, 108 E, 112 E, 116 E \n</div><div>•\tSMC 65 Series : SMC-2-65, 3-65, 4-65, 6-65, 8-65 \n</div><div>•\tC M O Series : 14, 16, 18, 24, 26, 28 \n</div><div>•\tT C M O Series : 18, 28 \n</div><div>•\tT S M C Series : 108, 116, 16-100, 8-100&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div><b>Accel Sabroe : Range :\n</b></div><div>\n</div><div>•\tSMC 100 Series: SMC-4-100, 6-100, 8-100, SMC 104 S, 106 S, 112 S, 116 S, SMC 104 J, 106 J, 108 J, 112 J , 116 J, SMC 104 E, 106 E, 108 E, 112 E, 116 E \n</div><div>•\tSMC 65 Series : SMC-2-65, 3-65, 4-65, 6-65, 8-65 \n</div><div>•\tC M O Series : 14, 16, 18, 24, 26, 28 \n</div><div>•\tT C M O Series : 18, 28 \n</div><div>•\tT S M C Series : 108, 116, 16-100, 8-100&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Carrier &amp; Voltas :\n</b></div><div>•\t5H Series : 5H-40, 60, 80, 120, 46, 66, 86, 126 \n</div><div>•\t5F Series : 5F-20, 30, 40, 60 \n</div><div>•\t06D Series : 06D-48, 68, 75, 018, 024, 037 \n</div><div>•\t06E Series : 06E Family (Semi Sealed)&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><b>York : Range :\n</b></div><div>•\t3DD50, G43, JS43, RS/W42, SS 62, 3DD100, G53, JS44, RS/W44, SS 63, 3DD125 \n</div><div>•\tG83, JS53, RS/W62, SS 82, G123, JS54, RS/W64, F3046, G163, JS63, RS/W82, Z 4CYL \n</div><div>•\tF3069, JS64, RS/W84, Z 6CYL, F3089, H92, JS73, RS/W122, F3129 \n</div><div>•\tH459, JS83, RS/W124, JS84, RS/W162, FS32, RS/W164, FS62, FS92 \n</div><div>•\tH - Series, J-G - Series, J-H - Series, J-K - Series, J-L - Series&nbsp;</div><div>•\tJ-M - Series, J-S - Series, SS - Series, Y - Series&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Trane :\n</b></div><div>•\tE Series : 3E 5H 40, 3E 5H 50, 3E 5H 60, 3E 5H 80 \n</div><div>•\tF Series : 3F 5B 30, 3F 5B 40, 3F 5B 50, 3F 5B 60 \n</div><div>•\tH Series : (Semi Sealed) \n</div><div>•\t75 Series : 4HC 75, 6HC 75, 8HC 75, 4C 75, 6C 75 \n</div><div>•\t55 Series : 4C 55, 6C 55, 3HC 55, 4HC 55, 6HC 55</div><p></p></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
